WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Sci-fi drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.280
called “Hashtag.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.960
In the near future, social media has become&nbsp;
a subject of world dominance and social media&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:26.640
celebrities have an immense influence on our&nbsp;
culture. The commoners follow them blindly and buy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:32.320
whatever product they endorse and consume. Such&nbsp;
media influencers sell their lives on the internet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:38.160
to a level that they have no privacy. Their main&nbsp;
motto is to not lose followers and they are ready&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:44.480
to go to extreme lengths to achieve that. One&nbsp;
of such influencers is a young woman named X.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:50.320
X lives in a tiny futuristic room that serves as&nbsp;
her workplace, lounging area, and her bedroom.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.720
At the beginning of the movie, she is in front&nbsp;
of a futuristic AI computer that displays her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:04.160
followers reacting to her content. They come and&nbsp;
go so quickly that X has to reply to more than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:10.000
fifty interactions per minute. An AI personnel&nbsp;
named Te’a helps her by posting the comments on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.760
her command and walking her through the activities&nbsp;
of the day. Every few minutes, Te’a reminds X to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.200
upload a status. Most of the time, X throws&nbsp;
in some inspirational quotes which get more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:27.040
than a hundred million likes. In her recent&nbsp;
status, she advises her followers to know and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:33.440
love what they’re doing for success. The status&nbsp;
alone gets one hundred and four million likes. 
&nbsp;

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:38.480
Te’a tells X when to stop working for the day.&nbsp;
It is clear that X doesn’t have much control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:43.600
over her life but she is too busy counting&nbsp;
her followers to notice. Her daily progress&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:48.000
is displayed on the screen which says that she&nbsp;
has gained more than a million followers in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.680
just one day making her followers count closer to&nbsp;
hitting a billion. She was mentioned twenty-seven&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:59.120
million times per minute, she received four&nbsp;
billion likes and nineteen million dislikes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:09.040
and her annual subscriber revenue is a whopping&nbsp;
nine and a half trillion dollars. The computer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:16.000
finally shuts off and she takes a sigh of relief.&nbsp;
Te’a again asks for her status and she recites&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.360
yet another motivational quote. More than a&nbsp;
hundred million people like the update instantly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.440
Even after getting off the computer, X is still&nbsp;
working. There is a cluster of cameras fitted on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:35.360
the ceiling to her room that live streams her life&nbsp;
to millions of special subscribers at all times.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:40.480
People pay millions of dollars to watch&nbsp;
her change clothes, sleep, read her emails,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:46.160
and so on. Her work desk automatically slides&nbsp;
underground and her bed emerges from the floor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.560
indicating it is her time to sleep. 
She takes her clothes off to go to bed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.800
when Te’a announces that there are two&nbsp;
hundred and four million subscribers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:00.480
watching her currently. The following morning,&nbsp;
X wakes up to gentle rain patting on her window.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:05.040
She gets up and immediately submits her&nbsp;
early morning status on Te’a’s request.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.920
X then takes a picture of herself, edits it&nbsp;
heavily, and posts it on the internet. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:15.280
she gets off the bed, she is completely naked. Her&nbsp;
body is censored to some of the followers who are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:20.240
told to upgrade their subscription to get the full&nbsp;
view. When it’s time for her to shower, a shower&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:24.640
room automatically arises in a corner of the&nbsp;
room. Even in the shower, three hundred million&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:30.000
premium subscribers are allowed to watch her. She&nbsp;
takes a picture with her body wash which increases&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.080
its sales by a lot. However, X’s subscriber&nbsp;
count goes downhill because of her next status&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:41.120
in which she implies that it is impossible&nbsp;
to argue with women. X quickly asks Te’a to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:46.240
take a picture of her body while showering&nbsp;
and posts it to all of her followers. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:51.040
doubles the count of new subscribers and&nbsp;
her status recovers again. X then requests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:56.880
her followers to vote for her on famous.com to&nbsp;
make her the greatest influencer of all time.
&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.320
Along with the request, she&nbsp;
attaches a nude picture of her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:05.360
When it is time for her to get ready for the day,&nbsp;
the room creates an automated wardrobe for her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:11.120
She simply asks the AI for a blue dress. The&nbsp;
command triggers a drone who flies around X&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.720
and creates a tailor-fitted dress according to her&nbsp;
wish. It also chooses appropriate accessories for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:21.600
her and makes her look pretty for the followers.&nbsp;
Because of her influence, the sales of the blue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:26.480
dress increases exponentially. As she is taking&nbsp;
pictures for the tenth time this morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:32.080
she receives her mails. On peeking through the&nbsp;
looking hole, she sees an empty hallway outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:37.200
It is time for her to check into work so she&nbsp;
ignores the mails for the time being. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:42.800
her computer screen goes black and a message&nbsp;
saying “do you question” flashes instead of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:48.560
comments. The screen goes back to normal in only&nbsp;
a few seconds so X doesn’t think much of it. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:54.560
without her noticing, an envelope that she just&nbsp;
received in the mail starts glowing. As X goes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:59.840
through the day, she eats all her meals in front&nbsp;
of the computer, promoting them for followers. 
&nbsp;

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:05.280
Some hours later, Te’a announces that it is&nbsp;
X’s time to relax. She gets only a ten-minute&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:09.360
break throughout the day. For the break, she&nbsp;
can choose a program from their computerized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:15.600
vacationing subscription. She gets to choose to go&nbsp;
to a virtual beach, party, spa, and others. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:20.160
shuffling through the options, she gets a papercut&nbsp;
from the envelope in her hand. She doesn’t think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:25.760
much of it and continues shuffling. The beach&nbsp;
seems a viable option but the people there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:31.440
are her fans who cannot stop gushing over her&nbsp;
presence, so she skips them. What she doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:37.600
notice is a strange man being formed on his own&nbsp;
in the background. Moments later, she stops to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:43.440
watch a firework display and is enjoying it until&nbsp;
the man from the beach starts walking towards her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.800
She feels uncomfortable and skips again but&nbsp;
the man is also present in the next program.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:54.000
He asks her if she questions her life or&nbsp;
just goes along with it. X is too scared to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:00.480
understand what he means. She retreats as the man&nbsp;
crosses the barrier and somehow enters her room.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:05.760
He raises his hands to touch her and the&nbsp;
contact gives rise to sparks of electricity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:12.240
The man disappears right after but he has provided&nbsp;
X with the ability to understand her reality. 
&nbsp;

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:18.240
Moments later, she composes herself and opens&nbsp;
the envelope for the first time. Inside is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:24.240
tablet that says “question everything”. When she&nbsp;
turns it around, the tablet asks her if her cage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:29.360
exists. She tries to comprehend what it means&nbsp;
and realizes that she has never been out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:35.200
her room which might mean that it is her cage.&nbsp;
She walks up to her door and leans down on it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:40.000
but because of her earlier interaction with the&nbsp;
guy, the stimulation doesn’t work on her and she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:45.440
falls to the other side. The horrifying&nbsp;
truth of her life is then revealed to X.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:50.720
It turns out that she is being used as a worker&nbsp;
by a multi-million dollar influencer company&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:56.640
that keeps them trapped in a tiny box in a&nbsp;
factory. She has been trapped and has been lied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:02.640
to about her life. Similar to her, the company&nbsp;
cages thousands of influencers and uses them for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:08.160
their own good. X quickly runs back to her room&nbsp;
and looks at the tablet again. Te’a announces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:13.360
that her break time is completed so she will have&nbsp;
to update her status soon. When X doesn’t answer,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:19.760
Te’a warns her of the consequences if she doesn’t&nbsp;
update her status. X cannot differentiate between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:24.720
the illusions and reality around her. 
Just then, the rain outside her window&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:30.160
starts to glitch. Te’a informs her that failing to&nbsp;
update her status is a violation of the celebrity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:36.160
franchise handbook. Having had enough of the&nbsp;
lies, X asks Te’a if she is in a cage. Te’a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:42.080
misunderstands X’s question for status and claims&nbsp;
that a question is an invalid status according to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:48.000
the handbook. X yet again asks her if is in a&nbsp;
cage. Instead of answering, the machine replies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:53.520
that all of her subscribers have left the room&nbsp;
and she has no followers now. X quickly tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:58.720
recover and takes her clothes off to show off her&nbsp;
body and regain the followers. But the strategy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:04.560
doesn’t work this time. She desperately tries to&nbsp;
take a seductive picture but Te’a stops answering.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:11.200
Following that, three men enter the room and drag&nbsp;
X outside as she retaliates. When she wakes up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:16.160
X is in a hospital bed being taken care&nbsp;
of by a machine. The door opens and two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:21.360
doctors enter the doom. Doctor Mitchell is&nbsp;
happy because X is her last eval of the day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:27.360
They look at her report and find out that X’s&nbsp;
real name is Alexandra. They ask X for status but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:32.800
she takes her time to reply. Because of the lag,&nbsp;
they diagnose that her speech and response time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:38.080
are lagging. She had been working for twenty-two&nbsp;
hours and the last sleep she had was around four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:43.520
hours. The doctors believe that her sleep cycle&nbsp;
is the root of the problem. As they discuss this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:49.200
X doesn’t respond with anything. She has a hard&nbsp;
time grasping reality. All of a sudden, she claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:54.160
that she has eight hundred million subscribers&nbsp;
but the doctor informs her they are all gone. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:59.680
call her old and believe that she is no longer&nbsp;
of service to the company. X starts to freak out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:04.080
because her followers’ count is the only thing&nbsp;
she has cared about until now. She insists that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:09.840
she is loved by her fans. However, the doctors&nbsp;
declare that it is her time to retire now. 
&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:15.040
The second doctor, Gil, finally shows his&nbsp;
face and reveals that he is the guy who met&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:20.640
X earlier in her room. He calms a frantic&nbsp;
X and leaves the room. Before leaving,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:25.680
doctor Mitchell comments about the increasing&nbsp;
number of crasher cases in the influencers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:30.320
One can assume that doctor Gil doesn’t agree&nbsp;
with the company’s values and is rescuing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:35.920
influencers, one after another. In the last&nbsp;
scene, a screen appears before X welcoming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:40.320
her to the internet as a consumer. 
